  "body": "Tucked away in one of Waiake's most sought-after streets, this beautifully presented home has been lovingly cared for over many years and is now ready to welcome its next family.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n- Beautifully renovated throughout and move-in ready\r\n- Sunny open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to a private backyard\r\n- 4 generous bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Formal lounge with the flexibility to become a fourth bedroom\r\n- Converted garage ideal as a recreation room, teenager's retreat or extended family space\r\n- Ducted heating system providing warmth and comfort throughout the bedrooms\r\n- Plenty of off-street parking for up to four vehicles, with room for a boat or motorhome\r\n- Easy-care, private backyard perfect for children, pets and entertaining\r\n- Prime Waiake location, just a short walk to Waiake Beach and Browns Bay town centre\r\n\r\nRecently renovated for modern living, the home is designed around effortless indoor-outdoor flow. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area opens seamlessly to a private, sun-soaked backyard, creating the perfect setting for summer BBQs, entertaining friends, or simply watching the kids and pets enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nInside, warmth and flexibility are at the heart of the design. Four generous bedrooms, with one offering the flexibility to easily convert into a formal lounge, while the converted garage offers a fantastic recreation room, teenager's retreat, or space for extended family. Ducted heating throughout the bedrooms keeps the home warm and comfortable during the cooler months.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features is the exceptional parking. Whether you have multiple vehicles, a boat, campervan or motorhome, there's plenty of space with generous off-street parking that comfortably accommodates up to four cars, offering flexibility that's increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the heart of Waiake, you're just a short stroll from the golden sands of Waiake Beach, with Browns Bay's vibrant cafes, restaurants, shops and local amenities all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nFilled with warmth, laughter and wonderful memories, this home has been cherished by the same owners for many years. Now, as they begin their next chapter, an exciting opportunity awaits for another family to call this special property home.",
